{"id":"561154e9a9","t":"The Reason Why That Villainess Picked up a Sword","c":"ml+io:/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/large_1000098946-193x278.jpg","n":81,"l":81,"s":["ml"],"k":{"ml":"the-reason-why-that-villainess-picked-up-a-sword"},"u":1795038430320,"desc":"جلالتك تريدك أن تسمعي هذا. عائلتك ستلحق بك قريبا. قتلت بعد سنوات من الإساءة والاتهامات الباطلة من زوجة أبيها. ظنت أن الأمر قد انتهى، وبعد تناسخين، عادت إلى هيئتها الأصلية، إيرين ريكسوس المعروفة بأعظم شريرة. قبل أن تفقد كل شيء وحتى أحباءها. “أعلم أن هناك أشياء لا يمكنك إخباري بها. عندما تكونين مستعدة، أخبريني.” الأمير الثاني اللطيف والرحيم، فردیناند ريكسوس. عندما عادت إلى الماضي وواجهته مجددًا، أقسمت على نفسها ستنقذه. حتى لو كلفها ذلك أن تصبح شريرة حقيقية.","type":"","status":"OnGoing","genres":["رومانسى","شوجو","فانتازيا","مانهوا"],"src":{"ml":"the-reason-why-that-villainess-picked-up-a-sword"},"chapters":{"1":{"ml":"the-reason-why-that-villainess-picked-up-a-sword|/manga/the-reason-why-that-villainess-picked-up-a-sword/1/"},"2":{"ml":"the-reason-why-that-villainess-picked-up-a-sword|/manga/the-reason-why-that-villainess-picked-up-a-sword/2/"},"3":{"ml":"the-reason-why-that-villainess-picked-up-a-sword|/manga/the-reason-why-that-villainess-picked-up-a-sword/3/"},"4":{"ml":"the-reason-why-that-villainess-picked-up-a-sword|/manga/the-reason-why-that-villainess-picked-up-a-sword/4/"},"5":{"ml":"the-reason-why-that-villainess-picked-up-a-sword|/manga/the-reason-why-that-villainess-picked-up-a-sword/5/"},"6":{"ml":"the-reason-why-that-villainess-picked-up-a-sword|/manga/the-reason-why-that-villainess-picked-up-a-sword/6/"},"7":{"ml":"the-reason-why-that-villainess-picked-up-a-sword|/manga/the-reason-why-that-villainess-picked-up-a-sword/7/"},"8":{"ml":"the-reason-why-that-villainess-picked-up-a-sword|/manga/the-reason-why-that-villainess-picked-up-a-sword/8/"},"9":{"ml":"the-reason-why-that-villainess-picked-up-a-sword|/manga/the-reason-why-that-villainess-picked-up-a-sword/9/"},"10":{"ml":"the-reason-why-that-villaines